<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction of 8.0 bln skr worth of T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction of 8.0 bln skr worth of T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday it would invite bids for an auction of Treasury bills.</p>
<p>The auction will take place on February 19, it said and bids are due at 1130 GMT on the day of the auction. Settlement date is February 21.</p>
<p> Maturity date		Issue volume	 Number of days</p>
<p> May 21, 1997		    5.0 bln		   90</p>
